#: skrooge/main.cpp:162
msgctxt "The description of the application"
msgid ""
"The application name is inspired by Charles Dicken's tale <i>A Christmas "
"Carol</i>, where the main character, Ebenezer Scrooge, a grumpy old narrow "
"man, gets visited by three ghosts who change the way he sees the world, in a "
"good way."
msgstr ""
"De Programmnaam wöör vun Charles Dickens sien Vertellsel <i>A Christmas "
"Carol</i> („En Wiehnachtsgeschicht“) anstött. Ebenezer Scrooge, de "
"Hööftpersoon, oolt un gniesgnaddelig, kriggt Besöök vun dree Spökels, de "
"amenn de Oort ännert, op de he de Welt süht."

